@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@contentType = application/json

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness check
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### List published articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles

### List corruption cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases

### Filter corruption cases by year/person/category/tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases?year=2026&personSlug=kemsa-covid-19-procurement-file&category=Investigations&tag=audit&limit=10&offset=0

### Search corruption cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/search?q=kemsa

### Related corruption cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/related?slug=kemsa-covid-19-procurement-audit&limit=4

### Get corruption case by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/kemsa-covid-19-procurement-audit

### Get corruption case views
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/kemsa-covid-19-procurement-audit/views

### Record corruption case view
POST {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/kemsa-covid-19-procurement-audit/views

### Corruption case key finding
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/kemsa-covid-19-procurement-audit/key-finding

### Corruption case sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/corruption-cases/kemsa-covid-19-procurement-audit/sources

### List published articles with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles?limit=20&offset=0

### Filter articles by year/person/category/tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles?year=2026&personSlug=example-person&category=Procurement&tag=audit&limit=10&offset=0

### Search articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/search?q=corruption

### Related articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/related?slug=example-slug&limit=4

### Related articles for a person
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/related?personId=PERSON_ID&limit=4

### Related articles for a person slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/related?personSlug=example-person&limit=4

### Get article by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/example-slug

### Get article views
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/example-slug/views

### Record article view
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles/example-slug/views

### Article key finding
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/example-slug/key-finding

### Article sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/example-slug/sources

### Submit article (guest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Investigative Report: Example",
  "subtitle": "Inside the audit trail",
  "excerpt": "A short summary that is at least 20 chars.",
  "content": "Long-form content that is at least 200 characters. This sample repeats enough detail to satisfy validation. It explains the case, provides context, lists evidence, and includes multiple sentences so the total length exceeds the minimum required by the API.",
  "featuredImage": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
  "images": ["https://example.com/image2.jpg"],
  "category": "Investigations",
  "subCategory": "Finance",
  "tags": ["kenya", "audit"],
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Court Filing",
      "url": "https://example.com/source",
      "description": "Filed on date.",
      "type": "document"
    }
  ],
  "isBreaking": false,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "isSponsored": false,
  "pseudonym": "Anon-Reporter",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### List comments for an article
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/articles/ARTICLE_ID

### Submit comment (guest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments/articles/ARTICLE_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "content": "This is a comment with sources.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Report",
      "url": "https://example.com/report",
      "description": "Relevant report.",
      "type": "report"
    }
  ],
  "pseudonym": "Anon-Reader",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### List corrupt persons
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons

### List corrupt persons with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons?limit=50&offset=0

### Get corrupt person by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons/example-person

### List cases for a person
GET {{baseUrl}}/cases/persons/6a0cff5493e8355c0a1e84d3

### Leaderboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?range=all&limit=10

### Leaderboard by range
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?range=week&limit=10

### Current weekly poll
GET {{baseUrl}}/polls/current

### Submit vote
POST {{baseUrl}}/polls/POLL_ID/votes
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "optionId": "PERSON_ID",
  "pseudonym": "Anon-Voter"
}

### News ticker
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticker

### Evidence trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/evidence/trail

### Content blocks
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/blocks?keys=polls.methodology,article.keyFinding.example-slug

### About page content
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/pages/about

### Site config
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/site

### Money analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/money

### Case analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/cases

### Stalled project analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/projects

### List stalled projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/stalled?status=stalled&limit=20

### Get stalled project by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/stalled/arror-kimwarer-multipurpose-dams
